  isBadDecision: 0
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: "But what a beautiful bluish iris! You could see the blossoming of a wonderful
      flower in spring.  If it isn\u2019t the little bloodstaples that mess up the
      painting"
  - speaker: 0
    text: Do you realize that this is the eye of someone who accompanied you throughout
      your expedition?!
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Precisely! I already told him during his lifetime that his eyes were splendid,
      I won\u2019t think so because they left their orbits!"
